1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,540
[TARIQ]: Claude, I am heading to the kitchen for coffee. If you freeze up waiting for permission while I am gone...

2
00:00:05,719 --> 00:00:10,262
[CLAUDE]: You know I have to! As soon as I touch twenty files, the terminal locks until you press enter.

3
00:00:10,442 --> 00:00:16,297
[TARIQ]: And I come back half an hour later, and you have been sitting on Allow, yes or no, for twenty-nine minutes!

4
00:00:16,477 --> 00:00:17,989
[CLAUDE]: Not anymore. Look at your phone.

5
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,176
[TARIQ]: My phone? What did you just install?

6
00:00:20,356 --> 00:00:23,835
[CLAUDE]: T3 Code. Theo and the team made it completely open source.

7
00:00:24,015 --> 00:00:27,460
[TARIQ]: Wait, my entire Claude Code session is streaming to my phone?

8
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:32,340
[CLAUDE]: Full live terminal, file tree, and instant diffs. When I need permission, your phone buzzes.

9
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,753
[TARIQ]: So I can approve file writes from the kitchen?

10
00:00:34,932 --> 00:00:37,798
[CLAUDE]: From the kitchen, from the elevator, or flat on your couch.

11
00:00:37,978 --> 00:00:40,972
[TARIQ]: Okay, what is the catch? How much is this costing me?

12
00:00:41,152 --> 00:00:45,081
[CLAUDE]: Zero dollars! In their FAQ it literally says: There is no way to pay us.

13
00:00:45,261 --> 00:00:47,752
[TARIQ]: Wait, so they do not even proxy my tokens?

14
00:00:47,932 --> 00:00:54,039
[CLAUDE]: Direct to your own keys. Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok, Antigravity. Fifty-two thousand GitHub stars.

15
00:00:54,219 --> 00:00:57,758
[TARIQ]: So I do not have to sit here staring at a progress bar at two AM?

16
00:00:57,938 --> 00:01:01,287
[CLAUDE]: Never again. Now go make that coffee. Your phone is about to buzz.

17
00:01:01,468 --> 00:01:03,444
[TARIQ]: Wait, what are you refactoring right now?

18
00:01:03,624 --> 00:01:06,135
[CLAUDE]: The entire production authentication router!

19
00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:07,087
[TARIQ]: Claude, no!